WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.250
"It's a good day for picking berries!" Dad said.

2
00:00:08.251 --> 00:00:11.792
The family was at a farm.

3
00:00:11.793 --> 00:00:15.744
There were rows of blueberry bushes.

4
00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:20.614
Everyone had a bucket.

5
00:00:20.615 --> 00:00:27.411
Harry ate several blueberries. "Mmm!"

6
00:00:27.412 --> 00:00:34.862
Emmy ate a few berries too. "Delicious!"

7
00:00:34.863 --> 00:00:41.608
Then Dad and Oliver ate some.

8
00:00:41.609 --> 00:00:44.045
Mom frowned.

9
00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:47.785
"Don't eat the berries now," she said.

10
00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:51.247
"I want to take lots of berries home.

11
00:00:51.248 --> 00:00:57.145
We will cook blueberry pancakes and blueberry pie."

12
00:00:57.146 --> 00:01:02.472
"Yum!" Harry and Emmy said.

13
00:01:02.473 --> 00:01:08.153
"I love blueberry pancakes and pie!" Oliver said.

14
00:01:08.154 --> 00:01:11.262
Oliver picked some ripe berries.

15
00:01:11.263 --> 00:01:16.065
"Pancakes and pie," Oliver said to himself.

16
00:01:16.066 --> 00:01:20.702
He put all the berries into his bucket.

17
00:01:20.703 --> 00:01:23.643
Emmy picked lots of berries.

18
00:01:23.644 --> 00:01:30.543
"Pancakes and pie," she said to herself.

19
00:01:30.544 --> 00:01:33.983
Her bucket got full quickly.

20
00:01:33.984 --> 00:01:36.871
Harry picked five berries.

21
00:01:36.872 --> 00:01:39.836
Then he ate just one.

22
00:01:39.837 --> 00:01:47.838
He did this over and over again.

23
00:01:47.839 --> 00:01:53.247
He filled his bucket.

24
00:01:53.248 --> 00:01:59.499
Dad picked lots of berries.

25
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.756
Then he ate a big handful.

26
00:02:03.757 --> 00:02:07.737
"Dad!" Oliver said.

27
00:02:07.738 --> 00:02:11.952
"Pancakes and pie!"

28
00:02:11.953 --> 00:02:14.901
"Sorry!" Dad said.

29
00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:23.871
He put the rest of the berries in his bucket.

30
00:02:23.872 --> 00:02:27.576
"My bucket is full," Emmy said.

31
00:02:27.577 --> 00:02:32.175
"So is mine," Harry said.

32
00:02:32.176 --> 00:02:39.700
Dad and Oliver had full buckets too.

33
00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:46.365
Everyone looked at Mom.

34
00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:53.331
Her lips were blue.

35
00:02:53.332 --> 00:02:59.060
Her bucket wasn't full.

36
00:02:59.061 --> 00:03:07.217
"Oops!" said Mom.

